{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:30 2026-07-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:30 2026-07-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:30 2026-07-15 HKT</p><p>今晚快活谷第二場四班千二米爆岀冷門，之前在港上陣十一次，從未上名的希廄「星威心得」今仗突如其來，在騎師金誠剛胯下沿內欄殺上，擊敗大熱門「天下寵兒」，爆出三十倍大冷贏馬，今次亦是希斯和金誠剛季內首次合作贏馬。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f57fa40e7fcb1bc92003a68b9874eab3/2026-07/0e9f37d6-b70b-4216-a212-af40c10d3cbd.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/54ba97f2f94f692a22e8e8936239bd30/2026-07/1d6b2c0d-b633-4d6a-bb8e-aecdafeff726.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b8b631ae7a4b8e3ce320a3a0009ab831/2026-07/4a34b68d-cabe-495c-8b9a-614a1050d340.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/85a63a7475f675bdb703d325e254d27b/2026-07/5b3af9a3-5df8-46ae-b0f7-69ed28af6fe3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/44de37acdbf03f6a9f075983468a0a4d/2026-07/94c5d7b1-07aa-48b7-a883-507f87e8a4d9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/862ab2bfe5afe8b3afe14f6c1d492fae/2026-07/128e29fd-25e0-4dfe-bc19-5ff2eb693f1f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/82f07810d9bf35941777fd223dee5301/2026-07/607fb861-0555-4c2d-8e6f-5f8e21c464bd.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5fecd724ee77f3386113fd8fc4557409/2026-07/3676d4c4-834d-445b-a823-b28c8c9689c6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/00c818bce5c50a38174449beb294d2b1/2026-07/91589077-d8a9-42d6-bb7f-4f444e22df40.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/56527ae0f78a7a311e230cac5e038898/2026-07/c2721588-1379-44f0-b1ab-a2b730800c19.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1534b8dc1c88112407ebcd95a3710d7/2026-07/f0b6fb95-a8eb-409c-98b0-b509c2d0eb11.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4cecf160b6409a2a0fc57aae548fcf6b/2026-07/f57865e7-34c0-43f3-80b6-77fbbcb88d9c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/059ced4c24a2ac85